{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1391646-crucible-of-legends","id":1391646,"title":"Crucible of Legends","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-26T01:28:09-07:00","id":1391646,"title":"Crucible of Legends","content":"... is in Manuscript Approval, which I think is generally not a long process, then there's art (which does take longer) and then it's out.<br /> So it should be out this year I guess.<br /> <br /> I'm certainly sure it'll be the next book out, though I guess the Exigents Kickstarter might be before it.<br /> <br /> Can people remember if it was said if there was any alternative rules in there? I remember it'll have an overview and QCs of Getimians, Infernals and Alchemicals. And ST advice, including for sorcerous workings. I don't remember anything else though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T01:48:22-07:00","id":1391650,"title":"","content":"Something I know nothing of is when does the kickstarter of an Exalted book start ? <br /> <br /> I really hope they will propose some alternative systems on certain components of the game. Having more unusable QC doesnt really interest me, what I need is actual mechanical help to propose challenge to players in varied ways. <br /> <br /> Sorcerous guide could be good for working and probably help balance and give cool ideas to ST and players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T01:59:32-07:00","id":1391651,"title":"","content":"I doubt Crucible will have a Kickstarter, they would have already done it by now. They only do Kickstarters for the splat books (and, Monica hopes, Essence edition), they didn't do one for Arms of the Chosen or The Realm. And I assume they won't do one for Across The Eight Directions.<br /> <br /> The last two Kickstarters were Dragonblood in March 2018 and Lunars in March 2019. I believe the intention was to do the Exigents Kickstarter in March 2020-ish, but there was some kind of issue with Heirs to the Shogunate that delayed everything so Exigents wasn't ready I guess? Hopefully the Exigents Kickstarter will be later this year (it's not the June Kickstarter though, I can tell you that).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-26T02:24:42-07:00","id":1391654,"title":